cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ELEVARE in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ELEVARE: An NLP-Driven Ikigai-Based Career Recommendation System"
abstract: >
  ELEVARE is a career recommendation system that fuses NLP, the Ikigai
  philosophical framework, Big Five psychometric modeling, and occupational
  market data into a unified, explainable recommendation pipeline.
  It uses EWMA-based longitudinal profiling via daily AI conversations
  powered by Llama 3.3 70B (Groq API).
